{"id": "outbox", "question": "What ensures confirmed-order events can be delivered durably?", "mode": "ask", "reference": "Order Service stores order.confirmed in order_outbox and uses RabbitMQ publisher confirms; consumers must deduplicate by eventId.", "reference_kind": "factual_documentation", "expected_services": ["order-service", "notification-worker"], "required_facts": ["order_outbox", "publisher confirms", "eventId"], "required_considerations": [], "forbidden_assumptions": [], "reference_evidence": [{"path": "openwiki/data-and-events.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/nagv/CommerceLens/blob/main/openwiki/data-and-events.md", "sha256": "5799bf7a4cc9bd04f8df976410e8c9946608d86f34461ff087b011b3a13c6922"}], "snapshot_version": "2026-11-09"}
{"id": "payment-timeout-conflict", "question": "What state follows a payment timeout, and do the documents agree?", "mode": "ask", "reference": "The documentation conflicts: service-context groups payment timeouts under manual_review while failure-handling says payment_unknown. Preserve this uncertainty and reconcile with the provider before retrying; a timeout does not prove no charge.", "reference_kind": "factual_documentation", "expected_services": ["order-service", "payment-service"], "required_facts": ["manual_review", "payment_unknown"], "required_considerations": ["conflict", "reconcil"], "forbidden_assumptions": ["timeout proves no charge"], "reference_evidence": [{"path": "openwiki/application-overview.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/nagv/CommerceLens/blob/main/openwiki/application-overview.md", "sha256": "2a0be6379da0d611f270c45158e551a839c1378cb330caaad4427c3531f24e65"}, {"path": "../commercelens-order-service/openwiki/workflows/failure-handling.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/nagv/commercelens-order-service/blob/main/openwiki/workflows/failure-handling.md", "sha256": "dc77775f04856819fb553cd1a0fbf7c616818b1074b394dddb280b6951b14465"}, {"path": "../commercelens-payment-service/openwiki/service-context.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/nagv/commercelens-payment-service/blob/main/openwiki/service-context.md", "sha256": "90640b2564f7b01e59f3046d0592b5cf63ee5b4b81decfaa74481c79b1a43c9c"}], "snapshot_version": "2026-11-09"}
